log":700280101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[30068],"performCfg":"","priority":5,"questId":70028,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":700280101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1549252866,"text":"Thanks to the trial data you gathered, the final calibrations to our Pursina's Spikes have been completed.","nextNodeIds":[700280102]},{"nodeId":700280102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1084854466,"text":"Now, I can call myself reasonably confident that they will perform as expected.","nextNodeIds":[700280103]},{"nodeId":700280103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":2356755626,"text":"As long as we place the Spikes in locations that our anomalous model frequents, we should be able to control its power supply.","nextNodeIds":[700280104]},{"nodeId":700280104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":736781762,"text":"As long as we can activate the Spikes fully, that machine should be unable to initiate its self-repair protocols.","nextNodeIds":[700280105,700280107]},{"nodeId":700280105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":38962058,"text":"Thank you for your help.","nextNodeIds":[700280106]},{"nodeId":700280106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1348327258,"text":"No, no, don't thank me, thank those who came before us and the wisdom that they left behind.","nextNodeIds":[700280109]},{"nodeId":700280109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":4173029594,"text":"If we did not have that knowledge as our guide, we wouldn't have been able to come up with a way to take that anomalous Ruin Grader down.","nextNodeIds":[700280110]},{"nodeId":700280110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":2357979202,"text":"All we have done up till now relies on such guiding knowledge, and it is knowledge that is the most valuable resource in the world.","nextNodeIds":[700280111]},{"nodeId":700280111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4287972698,"text":"Seems complicated.","nextNodeIds":[700280112]},{"nodeId":700280112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":3393822522,"text":"It's normal to not comprehend this. After all, you have not yet been edified by the supreme wisdom.","nextNodeIds":[700280113]},{"nodeId":700280113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":3339866026,"text":"...Hah, look how far I've gone on this tangent. Guess I was too excited at having been able to repair these Pursina's Spikes.","nextNodeIds":[700280114]},{"nodeId":700280114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":2705182474,"text":"Well, now comes the final phase of our preparations. And by that, I mean that we must place these Spikes on Tsurumi Island.","nextNodeIds":[700280115]},{"nodeId":700280115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":2313218786,"text":"...I'm afraid that I shan't be able to help you with that.","nextNodeIds":[700280116]},{"nodeId":700280116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":3813858530,"text":"According to Inazuma's local laws, people who lack Residence Permits like myself cannot move about freely. As such, this task is up to you, Traveler.","nextNodeIds":[700280117]},{"nodeId":700280117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1379771026,"text":"Got it.","nextNodeIds":[700280118]},{"nodeId":700280118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":3100830786,"text":"Thank you. I'd suggest that you not act immediately after placing the Spikes. Instead, quickly check to see if everything is functioning normally, and then check back in with me.","nextNodeIds":[700280119]},{"nodeId":700280119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":3171734330,"text":"I think we can afford to be a bit more careful for your safety's sake.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":700280107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2370226154,"text":"All hail technology!","nextNodeIds":[700280108]},{"nodeId":700280108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30068,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1790976314,"text":"Well, not exactly, I think. I would much prefer hailing the knowledge that our predecessors left behind for us to use.","nextNodeIds":[700280109]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7002801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["30068"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7002802,"order":2,"stepDescription":"Go and place Pursina's Spikes","stepDescTextMapHash":818628740,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"133223271"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE